# Airymax [SC] shared contract headers - UAPI export
#
# Per scripts/Makefile.headersinst, all .h files under include/uapi/
# are automatically exported to userspace via `make headers_install`.
# This Kbuild file does NOT define any no-export-headers entries,
# meaning every .h file in this directory is exported.
#
# 10 core [SC] headers (auto-exported):
#   cognition_types.h, error.h, ipc.h, log_types.h, lsm_types.h,
#   memory_types.h, sched.h, security_types.h, syscalls.h, uapi_compat.h
#
# 1 supplementary [SC] header (auto-exported):
#   bpf_struct_ops.h (struct_ops state machine validation)
#
# 1 codegen internal header (auto-exported):
#   syscall.h (generated by tools/codegen/syscall_gen.py)
#
# 1 SSoT source (NOT a header, not exported):
#   syscall.xml (codegen single source of truth)
#
# See: OS-IRON-014 for [SC] single physical host constraint
# See: scripts/Makefile.headersinst for export mechanism
